09:30.559 --> 09:31.840
Mari, tengok.

09:32.720 --> 09:34.120
Cantik betul lukisan ni.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.399
Terima kasih ya.

09:36.679 --> 09:37.279
Fei Ni dah sampai.

09:37.600 --> 09:38.399
Fei Ni.

09:38.679 --> 09:39.120
Fang Muyang.

09:39.120 --> 09:39.799
Awak datang.

09:39.799 --> 09:41.360
Awak lukis saya nampak tua sangat.

09:41.639 --> 09:42.240
