16:58.200 --> 16:59.080
awak kena berjimat ikut sukatan.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.360
Aku dah ajar awak.

17:00.759 --> 17:02.200
Kalau ikut cara awak berbelanja,

17:02.600 --> 17:03.879
